UNCERTAINTY-LINE replication audit
  arch:    phi-4-mini-instruct
  target:  lift_em = +1 (paper headline)
  n_seeds: 5 (LINE_split averaging)
  pool:    11 signals
  columns:
    raw       = AUROC on the raw signal (no detrend)
    ours      = our protocol: signal - OLS(signal ~ log(tokens+1))
                fit and evaluated on the FULL cohort
    LINE_f    = UL math (Vashurin 2025): MinMax-norm signal+length
                + LinearRegression(signal_norm ~ length_norm) on FULL cohort
                → APPLES-TO-APPLES sample size with `ours`
    LINE_s    = UL faithful: same math but TRAIN/TEST split (70/30),
                averaged over 5 seeds → matches UL paper's protocol
    ε_proto   = |ours − LINE_f|  (isolates math: log vs raw-MinMax)
    ε_sample  = |LINE_f − LINE_s|  (isolates evaluation-set sampling noise)

