      0.1144   phi-4-mini-instruct × HotpotQA-distractor    AID late_flips

  protocol verdict: MOSTLY EQUIVALENT — small differences attributable to (log vs raw-MinMax) regressor choice on the same evaluation set.
  sampling note: UL's train/test split contributes ε up to 0.191 AUROC at our n=200; this is sampling noise, not a protocol difference.
